{
  "title": "布局压力测试：宽表格与固定宽度图片",
  "author": "ReadS 测试样本",
  "url": "https://example.com/layout-stress",
  "feedTitle": "布局测试源",
  "summary": "用于回归测试阅读区布局：正文里包含一个列数很多的宽表格，以及多张带 width 属性的固定宽度图片。",
  "content": "<p>这是一段用于回归测试的正文。订阅源的真实内容里经常出现固定宽度的图片、列数很多的表格，以及不可断行的长串。这些东西一旦把阅读区的宽度撑开，就会顶宽整个弹性布局，导致右侧被窗口裁掉。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>列一</th><th>列二</th><th>列三</th><th>列四</th><th>列五</th><th>列六</th><th>列七</th><th>列八</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>相当长的一段单元格内容用来撑开最小宽度</td><td>alpha</td><td>beta</td><td>gamma</td><td>delta</td><td>epsilon</td><td>zeta</td><td>eta</td></tr><tr><td>第二行同样很长的一段单元格内容</td><td>1</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>6</td><td>7</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>下面是三张带固定宽度属性的图片，它们是历史上最容易撑破布局的元素。</p><img width=\"500\" height=\"300\" alt=\"固定宽度图片 1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22300%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20fill%3D%22%232f78e8%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22250%22%20y%3D%22165%22%20font-size%3D%2234%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%3Ewidth%3D500%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><img width=\"500\" height=\"300\" alt=\"固定宽度图片 2\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22300%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20fill%3D%22%231fa97a%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22250%22%20y%3D%22165%22%20font-size%3D%2234%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%3Ewidth%3D500%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><img width=\"500\" height=\"300\" alt=\"固定宽度图片 3\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22300%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22500%22%20height%3D%22300%22%20fill%3D%22%23c63c82%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22250%22%20y%3D%22165%22%20font-size%3D%2234%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%3Ewidth%3D500%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\"><pre><code>一段很长的不可断行代码：aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</code></pre><p>结尾段落，用于确认正文在窄栏里仍然正常换行，而不会被上面的元素推到窗口之外。</p>"
}
